{"ref":"BDB, רָגַל","hw":"רָגַל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רָגַל</span></big>  <strong>vb.denom. foot it, go about</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  <em>go about</em> (maliciously, <em>as slanderer;</em> cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">مُشَاةٌ</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">سَاعٍ</span> <em>slanderer</em>, from √√ <span dir=\"rtl\">مَشَى</span> <em>walk along</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">سَعَى</span> <em>walk quickly</em>), <em>slander,</em> Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">לאֹ־ר׳ עַל־לְשֹׁנוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 15:3\" href=\"/Psalms.15.3\">ψ 15:3</a> <em>he takes no slander upon his tongue</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דֹּבֵר אֱמֶת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Psalms 15:2\" href=\"/Psalms.15.2\">2</a>).<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְרַגֵּל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:28\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.28\">2 S 19:28</a>, 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְרַגְּלוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:24\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.24\">Dt 1:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:2\" href=\"/Joshua.7.2\">Jos 7:2</a>; Imv. mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">רַגְּלוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:2\" href=\"/Joshua.7.2\">Jos 7:2</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְרַגֵּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:32\" href=\"/Numbers.21.32\">Nu 21:32</a> + 5 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְרַגְּלַהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.3\">2 S 10:3</a>; Pt. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְרַגְּלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:9\" href=\"/Genesis.42.9\">Gn 42:9</a> + 11 times;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>slander</em> (cf. <strong>Qal</strong>), <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְר׳ בְּעַבְדְּךָ אֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:28\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.28\">2 S 19:28</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>go about as explorer, spy</em>, c. acc. loc. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:32\" href=\"/Numbers.21.32\">Nu 21:32</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:25\" href=\"/Joshua.6.25\">Jos 6:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:2\" href=\"/Joshua.7.2\">7:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:2\" href=\"/Joshua.7.2\">2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:7\" href=\"/Joshua.14.7\">14:7</a> (all JE), <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:2\" href=\"/Judges.18.2\">Ju 18:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָקַר</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:14\" href=\"/Judges.18.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:17\" href=\"/Judges.18.17\">17</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.3\">2 S 10:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָקַר</span>), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.3\">1 Ch 19:3</a>, so also pt. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:30\" href=\"/Genesis.42.30\">Gn 42:30</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:22\" href=\"/Joshua.6.22\">Jos 6:22</a> (JE); pt., acc. om., as adj., <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲנַשִׁים מְרַגְּלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:1\" href=\"/Joshua.2.1\">Jos 2:1</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:23\" href=\"/Joshua.6.23\">6:23</a> (both JE); as subst., <em>spies</em> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 26:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.26.4\">1 S 26:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.10\">2 S 15:10</a>, and so perhaps (as pred.) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:9\" href=\"/Genesis.42.9\">Gn 42:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:11\" href=\"/Genesis.42.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:14\" href=\"/Genesis.42.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:16\" href=\"/Genesis.42.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:31\" href=\"/Genesis.42.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:34\" href=\"/Genesis.42.34\">34</a> (all E).<br><strong>Tiph.</strong>  Pf. 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּרְגַּלְתִּי לְאֶכְּרַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 11:3\" href=\"/Hosea.11.3\">Ho 11:3</a> <em>I taught</em> Ephr. <em>to walk</em> (si vera l.; v. Ges<sup>§ 55 h</sup>).","next":"BDB, רֹגֵל","prev":"BDB, רֶ֫גֶל"}